<title>UK: Dalgety half year profits fall.</title>
<headline>Dalgety half year profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year tp December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.3		    vs 10.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.5		    vs 8.5</p>
<p> Operating profit	 53.8		   vs 57.0</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excepts    43.0		   vs 47.0</p>
<p> Turnover		   2.195 bln	    vs 2.179 bln</p>
<p>Full company name - Dalgety Plc</p>
